# Caddy in front of a self-hosted Stoppeklokke (docs/self-hosting.md).
# Caddy gets and renews the TLS certificate automatically; HTTPS is required
# (passkeys and the __Host- session cookie only work over HTTPS).
#
# Replace the domain. Caddy appends the client address to X-Forwarded-For;
# Stoppeklokke believes it only from addresses listed in TRUSTED_PROXIES.

stoppeklokke.example.com {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8787
}
